 "notes": "All 12 planned kinds kept. Climbing shoe, harness, rope, belay device, carabiner, quickdraw and helmet given archetypes from fetched pages; sling, chalk bag, chalk, belay glove and rope bag kept as kinds with types and old models. Dropped duplicate/marginal old models (e.g. Black Diamond harness duplicates trimmed: Blue Ice Cuesta, DMM Puma/Vixen, Edelrid Sendero, Mammut 4 Slide/Togir, Petzl Aquila/Tour; Edelrid Kinglet/Siskin ropes; DMM Figure of 8 and Petzl Huit folded into the figure-of-eight archetype; several helmets). Five Ten Anasazi year and Miura year left blank (not on retrieved pages). Sterling, Beal, Boreal, Kong founding years omitted (unsure). Shoe brief items covered: Solution, Miura, Anasazi, Instinct; Mammut Smart covered without launch year (retailer pages only)."
